   BETA SOFTWARE ANNOUNCEMENT
   ÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄÄ
   This version of QFront is not a "release version".  It is a  "wide-beta"
   version.  As such, there may be bugs in the code.  Although we have done
   our best to remove the bugs, the only way to find them all is to get the
   program out to the public.  Therefore, if you find a bug, please contact
   us immediately.  There is information on how to do this above (see  "bug
   reports").















































                                QFront v1.20a
